appen to Mr. Robbins now?","options":["He will change his name to Ruiz","He will go to jail in Argentina","He will work as a florist","He will be returned to the United States"],"answer":"D","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-14","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-086","set":"D1","n":86,"part":4,"q":"What does this announcement concern?","options":["Rainy weather","Weekly duties","Late employees","Late buses"],"answer":"C","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-15","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-087","set":"D1","n":87,"part":4,"q":"How often are employees late?","options":["Three times a week","Five times a week","Ten times a week","Every day"],"answer":"D","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-15","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-088","set":"D1","n":88,"part":4,"q":"What problem do late employees cause?","options":["The bus driver has to stand in the rain","Employees at other stops wait longer for the bus","The late employees lose their pay","The punctual employees are on time"],"answer":"B","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-15","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-089","set":"D1","n":89,"part":4,"q":"What type of company is this?","options":["Clothing store","Restaurant","Camping equipment store","Baby furniture store"],"answer":"A","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-16","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-090","set":"D1","n":90,"part":4,"q":"How long is the sale?","options":["Half a day","Two days","All spring","All year"],"answer":"B","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-16","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-091","set":"D1","n":91,"part":4,"q":"How much are infants’ clothes?","options":["Half price","$5.95","$7.98","$9.95"],"answer":"A","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-16","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-092","set":"D1","n":92,"part":4,"q":"What happened in downtown Riverdale?","options":["A water pipe broke","People were injured","There was an accident","People had to leave their homes"],"answer":"D","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-17","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-093","set":"D1","n":93,"part":4,"q":"How high did the water rise?","options":["Half a meter","A little less than one meter","Just over one meter","More than a meter and a half"],"answer":"D","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-17","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-094","set":"D1","n":94,"part":4,"q":"When did the rain stop?","options":["Saturday afternoon","Sunday evening","Monday evening","Wednesday morning"],"answer":"C","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-17","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-095","set":"D1","n":95,"part":4,"q":"What type of company would leave this message?","options":["An airline company","A movie theater","A travel company","A phone company"],"answer":"A","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-18","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-096","set":"D1","n":96,"part":4,"q":"What happens if the caller presses 2?","options":["The caller hears a movie schedule","The caller can buy tickets","The caller hears a flight schedule","The caller can buy luggage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-18","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-097","set":"D1","n":97,"part":4,"q":"How can the caller speak with a person?","options":["Press 1","Wait","Call for a ticket agent","Look for the number online"],"answer":"B","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-18","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-098","set":"D1","n":98,"part":4,"q":"Where will the concert be?","options":["In a parking lot","In City Hall","In a library","In a park"],"answer":"D","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-19","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-099","set":"D1","n":99,"part":4,"q":"When will the concert be held if the weather is bad?","options":["Friday","Saturday","Sunday","Monday"],"answer":"C","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-19","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-100","set":"D1","n":100,"part":4,"q":"How much are the tickets?","options":["Free","$3.00","$7.00","$30.00"],"answer":"A","explanation":"","group":"D1-listen-19","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-101","set":"D1","n":101,"part":5,"q":"Now that the company has changed ownership, we can expect to _____ a great many changes to our staff and structure.","options":["undermine","underlie","undergo","underdo"],"answer":"C","explanation":"undergo changes: trải qua thay đổi; sau to là động từ nguyên mẫu.","group":"101","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-102","set":"D1","n":102,"part":5,"q":"_____ direct link exists between acidic soil and tooth decay, according to public health officials.","options":["There is a","A","That there is a","Because"],"answer":"B","explanation":"A direct link: danh từ đếm được số ít cần mạo từ a.","group":"102","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-103","set":"D1","n":103,"part":5,"q":"Passengers are hereby notified that all luggage _____ one hour before the scheduled departure time.","options":["will check","will be checked","checks","has checked"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Will be checked: tương lai bị động = will be + V3.","group":"103","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-104","set":"D1","n":104,"part":5,"q":"People who do not _____ with the rules set forth in this notice will be asked to leave.","options":["comply","agree","analyze","experiment"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Comply with regulations/rules: tuân thủ quy định.","group":"104","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-105","set":"D1","n":105,"part":5,"q":"_____ in large quantities is not necessarily an indication of its quality.","options":["A product is sold","It is a product sold","That a product is sold","A product sells"],"answer":"C","explanation":"That + mệnh đề có thể làm chủ ngữ; that a product is sold...","group":"105","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-106","set":"D1","n":106,"part":5,"q":"The new security guard on the first floor is _____ person that everyone likes him.","options":["a such nice","a so nice","such nice","such a nice"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Such + a/an + tính từ + danh từ + that: ...đến mức mà...","group":"106","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-107","set":"D1","n":107,"part":5,"q":"No one is allowed on the _____ without a pass from the security desk.","options":["promises","premises","compromises","comprises"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Premises: khuôn viên/cơ sở; cụm on the premises.","group":"107","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-108","set":"D1","n":108,"part":5,"q":"The cost of the necklace depends _____ the quality of the gold.","options":["to","on","of","about"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Depend on: phụ thuộc vào; “on” là giới từ cố định.","group":"108","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-109","set":"D1","n":109,"part":5,"q":"We have _____ responsibility for the budget to Samantha, so Max is no longer in charge of it.","options":["accounted","expected","dismissed","assigned"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Assign responsibility for ... to somebody: giao trách nhiệm.","group":"109","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-110","set":"D1","n":110,"part":5,"q":"I wish I _____ the answer to your question so I could help you.","options":["would know","knew","know","have known"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Wish + S + V2: ước điều trái với hiện tại; I wish I knew.","group":"110","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-111","set":"D1","n":111,"part":5,"q":"We ask that all important correspondence be sent by registered _____ certified mail.","options":["or","however","but","yet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Or nối hai lựa chọn trong cùng cấu trúc ngữ pháp.","group":"111","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-112","set":"D1","n":112,"part":5,"q":"The assistant jumped up on a chair and screamed when he saw a mouse _____ across the lounge.","options":["ran","run","runs","had run"],"answer":"B","explanation":"See + somebody + V nguyên mẫu: chứng kiến toàn bộ hành động.","group":"112","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-113","set":"D1","n":113,"part":5,"q":"_____ the plumber could repair the toilet, he still would not do it.","options":["Therefore","However","So","Even if"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Even if: ngay cả khi; chỉ giả định, không phải mặc dù.","group":"113","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-114","set":"D1","n":114,"part":5,"q":"The laborers were _____ with mud after spending all day digging the ditch.","options":["covering","cover","covered","coverage"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Covered with mud: bị bao phủ bởi bùn; bị động rút gọn.","group":"114","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-115","set":"D1","n":115,"part":5,"q":"_____ his joining the group late, his manager is confident that he will fit right in.","options":["Even though","Despite","If","However"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Despite + danh từ/V-ing: mặc dù; khác although + mệnh đề.","group":"115","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-116","set":"D1","n":116,"part":5,"q":"I filed my report last week, but now I wish I _____.","options":["have waited","waited","had waited","wait"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Wish + past perfect: tiếc một việc đã không xảy ra trong quá khứ.","group":"116","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-117","set":"D1","n":117,"part":5,"q":"The doctors will be ready to go home as soon as they _____ their rounds.","options":["will finish","will have finished","are finishing","finish"],"answer":"D","explanation":"As soon as + hiện tại đơn diễn tả tương lai trong mệnh đề thời gian.","group":"117","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-118","set":"D1","n":118,"part":5,"q":"Vice President D’Agostino had her driver _____ her husband at the airport.","options":["picking up","to pick up","pick up","picked up"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Have + someone + V: nhờ/yêu cầu ai làm gì (causative have).","group":"118","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-119","set":"D1","n":119,"part":5,"q":"Mrs. Kurtoglu is a fast learner, and she has _____ mastered the drafting techniques.","options":["already","ever","yet","still"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Already thường chỉ hành động đã hoàn thành trước thời điểm nhắc đến.","group":"119","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-120","set":"D1","n":120,"part":5,"q":"We have to complete the project because we still have a _____ obligation.","options":["contract","contractual","contracts","contracting"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Contractual obligation: nghĩa vụ theo hợp đồng.","group":"120","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-121","set":"D1","n":121,"part":5,"q":"Who _____ how many of our clients can contact us at our new office?","options":["knows","is knowing","has known","are knowing"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Who knows...? Chủ ngữ đại từ nghi vấn “who” dùng knows.","group":"121","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-122","set":"D1","n":122,"part":5,"q":"The advertising staff has been working hard but has not finished the campaign _____.","options":["still","yet","anymore","already"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Not ... yet: hành động chưa xảy ra tính đến hiện tại.","group":"122","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-123","set":"D1","n":123,"part":5,"q":"The high gross _____ product is an outcome of their work ethic.","options":["nationally","nationwide","nation","national"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Gross national product: tổng sản phẩm quốc dân (GNP).","group":"123","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-124","set":"D1","n":124,"part":5,"q":"Our company has chosen the Swedish vendor _____ they guarantee the best after-sales service.","options":["and","because","but","so"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Because + clause: bởi vì; khác because of + cụm danh từ.","group":"124","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-125","set":"D1","n":125,"part":5,"q":"The employee manual needs to be revised because much of the _____ is out of date.","options":["contempt","contest","content","contend"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Content (noun): nội dung; phân biệt adjective content = hài lòng.","group":"125","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-126","set":"D1","n":126,"part":5,"q":"Most small business owners are required to file their taxes _____.","options":["quarterly","usually","anymore","still"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Annually (adv): hằng năm; trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho hành động.","group":"126","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-127","set":"D1","n":127,"part":5,"q":"We plan to hire a number of new staff members and will have to _____ our workspace in order to have room for them.","options":["expend","enormous","extent","enlarge"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Enlarge workspace: mở rộng diện tích không gian làm việc.","group":"127","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-128","set":"D1","n":128,"part":5,"q":"Because of the strong economy, there has been an increase in exported _____ imported goods.","options":["and","though","or","still"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Although/even though diễn tả tương phản; ở đây hai mặt hàng xuất/nhập khẩu.","group":"128","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-129","set":"D1","n":129,"part":5,"q":"If Fujikin, Inc. _____ more available capital, they would have expanded their European operations.","options":["has","had had","were having","has had"],"answer":"B","explanation":"If + had + V3, would have + V3: điều kiện loại 3, trái quá khứ.","group":"129","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-130","set":"D1","n":130,"part":5,"q":"_____ the patient’s condition get worse, the nurse will call in an internist.","options":["Might","Unless","Should","If"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Should + S + V = If + S + should + V: đảo ngữ điều kiện.","group":"130","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-131","set":"D1","n":131,"part":5,"q":"For reasons of public safety, the firefighters will not respond _____ the call is verified.","options":["and","until","even","because"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Until + mệnh đề: đến khi; diễn tả thời hạn.","group":"131","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-132","set":"D1","n":132,"part":5,"q":"All shareholders must fill out a _____ slip in order to get money.","options":["withdraw","withdrawing","withdrawal","withdrawn"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Withdrawal slip: phiếu rút tiền; withdrawal là danh từ làm định ngữ.","group":"132","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-133","set":"D1","n":133,"part":5,"q":"The training staff does not have to attend the meeting, _____ they will anyway.","options":["but","and","or","already"],"answer":"A","explanation":"But: liên từ tương phản giữa hai ý.","group":"133","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-134","set":"D1","n":134,"part":5,"q":"I will never forget _____ the beautiful country of Thailand during the summer after I graduated from college.","options":["to visit","visited","visiting","visit"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Forget + V-ing: quên một trải nghiệm từng xảy ra.","group":"134","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-135","set":"D1","n":135,"part":5,"q":"You can get _____ from the company for any money you spend on business travel.","options":["confidence","expansion","completion","reimbursement"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Reimbursement for expenses: hoàn trả khoản chi phí đã chi.","group":"135","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-136","set":"D1","n":136,"part":5,"q":"Our friends offered _____ us some of their camping equipment for our trip to the mountains.","options":["lending","to lend","to have lent","on lending"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Offer to do something: đề nghị làm việc gì.","group":"136","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-137","set":"D1","n":137,"part":5,"q":"All trainees _____ eighty hours of instruction by the end of March.","options":["complete","will have completed","will be completing","have completed"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Will have + V3: tương lai hoàn thành, trước một mốc tương lai.","group":"137","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-138","set":"D1","n":138,"part":5,"q":"After we announced the job opening, we received hundreds of _____ for the position.","options":["applications","employments","supervisors","advertisements"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Application for a job: đơn xin việc/hồ sơ ứng tuyển.","group":"138","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-139","set":"D1","n":139,"part":5,"q":"I broke a tooth when I _____ into a piece of hard candy.","options":["bite","had bitten","have bitten","bit"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Bite – bit – bitten; quá khứ đơn của bite là bit.","group":"139","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-140","set":"D1","n":140,"part":5,"q":"If Dr. Puri did not like jazz, he _____ to it so much.","options":["would listen","would not listen","would not have listened","would be listening"],"answer":"B","explanation":"If + past simple, would + V: điều kiện loại 2 giả định hiện tại.","group":"140","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-141","set":"D1","n":141,"part":6,"q":"We received your e-mail requesting to close your savings account. Unfortunately, we are unable to _____ with the request because it was sent by e-mail.","options":["comply","compliant","compliance","complicate"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Comply with + requirement: tuân thủ/đáp ứng yêu cầu.","group":"D1-p141","passage":"D1-p141","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-142","set":"D1","n":142,"part":6,"q":"We hope that you have been happy with _____ and will consider using our bank again in the future.","options":["me","us","him","them"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Happy with us: hài lòng với chúng tôi.","group":"D1-p141","passage":"D1-p141","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-143","set":"D1","n":143,"part":6,"q":"If you are closing your account because you have had an _____ experience, please contact our customer service representatives.","options":["adequate","efficient","interesting","unsatisfactory"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Unsatisfactory experience: trải nghiệm không tốt.","group":"D1-p141","passage":"D1-p141","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-144","set":"D1","n":144,"part":6,"q":"You asked me to e-mail you about the _____ of my office.","options":["color","location","condition","dimension"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Condition of the office: tình trạng văn phòng.","group":"D1-p144","passage":"D1-p144","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-145","set":"D1","n":145,"part":6,"q":"I’d also like a conference table for _____ with clients.","options":["meet","to meet","meeting","will meet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"For + V-ing: mục đích sử dụng phòng.","group":"D1-p144","passage":"D1-p144","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-146","set":"D1","n":146,"part":6,"q":"Maybe my current computer has it, but I _____ find it.","options":["should not","could not","must not","may not"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Could not find it: không tìm thấy phần mềm.","group":"D1-p144","passage":"D1-p144","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-147","set":"D1","n":147,"part":6,"q":"Maria Robles has _____ from her position on the IT Committee.","options":["reacted","resigned","rejoined","resisted"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Resign from a position: từ chức.","group":"D1-p147","passage":"D1-p147","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-148","set":"D1","n":148,"part":6,"q":"Your time commitment would be minimal; however, the _____ is an important one.","options":["respond","responsible","responsibly","responsibility"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Responsibility (noun) theo sau mạo từ the.","group":"D1-p147","passage":"D1-p147","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-149","set":"D1","n":149,"part":6,"q":"Our company’s sales _____ because news spread about our anti-hacking devices.","options":["have stagnated","have increased","have declined","have stalled"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Sales have increased: hiện tại hoàn thành chỉ kết quả.","group":"D1-p147","passage":"D1-p147","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-150","set":"D1","n":150,"part":6,"q":"I don’t know if the train is always so expensive or if this is considered a peak time of year for _____ travel.","options":["air","road","rail","sea"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Air travel: du lịch bằng đường hàng không.","group":"D1-p150","passage":"D1-p150","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-151","set":"D1","n":151,"part":6,"q":"Since the conference is free _____ charge for all GBC members, Waterworks has offered to put us up in a 5-star hotel.","options":["at","in","by","of"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Free of charge: hoàn toàn miễn phí.","group":"D1-p150","passage":"D1-p150","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-152","set":"D1","n":152,"part":6,"q":"It has a spa, a heated indoor pool, tennis courts, and three restaurants. We definitely won’t be _____ there.","options":["bore","bored","boring","boredom"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Be bored: bị buồn chán.","group":"D1-p150","passage":"D1-p150","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-153","set":"D1","n":153,"part":7,"q":"What kind of company is Yamitomo International?","options":["An electronics manufacturer","A computer distributor","A music company","A moving company"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “An electronics manufacturer”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p153","passage":"D1-p153","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-154","set":"D1","n":154,"part":7,"q":"What is the focus of this passage?","options":["Musical artists are given much freedom with Yamitomo.","Analog cassettes were developed by Yamitomo.","Music and media products are sold by Yamitomo.","Yamitomo has a reputation of excellence, diversity, and innovation."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Yamitomo has a reputation of excellence, diversity, and innovation.”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p153","passage":"D1-p153","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-155","set":"D1","n":155,"part":7,"q":"Who is the audience for this advertisement?","options":["Japanese electronics manufacturers","Security system installation companies","Electronics wholesalers","Magazine publishers"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Electronics wholesalers”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p155","passage":"D1-p155","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-156","set":"D1","n":156,"part":7,"q":"What is offered in this advertisement?","options":["Electronics components","Corporate changes","Magazines","Computer products"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Magazines”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p155","passage":"D1-p155","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-157","set":"D1","n":157,"part":7,"q":"Why was this letter written?","options":["To show appreciation to long-term employees","To explain the changes that have taken place","To explain that changes are necessary in the near future","To recruit new members"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “To explain that changes are necessary in the near future”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p157","passage":"D1-p157","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-158","set":"D1","n":158,"part":7,"q":"What does the writer of this letter hope for?","options":["Innovation in the manufacturing process","Customers","A growth in club membership","A reputation in the automotive industry"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Innovation in the manufacturing process”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p157","passage":"D1-p157","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-159","set":"D1","n":159,"part":7,"q":"Where would this letter be most likely to appear?","options":["In a trade publication","In a company newsletter","In an executive memo","In a community newspaper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “In a company newsletter”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p157","passage":"D1-p157","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-160","set":"D1","n":160,"part":7,"q":"What is the most noticeable characteristic of the river?","options":["Its location","Its direction","Its rate of flow","Its color"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Bài đọc nhấn mạnh sắc cam đậm của dòng nước – its color.","group":"D1-p160","passage":"D1-p160","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-161","set":"D1","n":161,"part":7,"q":"What has been the outcome of the silting of Lake Maracaibo?","options":["Fishing grounds have been increased.","The loss of protein has been offset by the economic development of the mining.","There has been an increase in the risk of flooding.","Mining and flooding have been kept in check."],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “There has been an increase in the risk of flooding.”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p160","passage":"D1-p160","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-162","set":"D1","n":162,"part":7,"q":"Where should one send reservations?","options":["To Dr. Srivastava’s office","To the Hall of World Cultures of Knotty Pines","To the luncheon hall","To the National Society of Fundraising Executives’ office"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “To the Hall of World Cultures of Knotty Pines”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p162","passage":"D1-p162","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-163","set":"D1","n":163,"part":7,"q":"Who should contact Dr. Srivastava?","options":["Potential society members","Current society members","Any international representatives","Fundraising experts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Potential society members”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p162","passage":"D1-p162","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-164","set":"D1","n":164,"part":7,"q":"What type of chart is this?","options":["An inventory list","An industry report","An advertisement","A sales report"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Bảng thể hiện giá trị giao hàng thiết bị ngành khai mỏ theo năm – ngành công nghiệp.","group":"D1-p164","passage":"D1-p164","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-165","set":"D1","n":165,"part":7,"q":"What was the decrease in mineral processing equipment?","options":["3 percent","4 percent","14 percent","18 percent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Hàng mineral-processing equipment giảm 4%, đọc cột phần trăm.","group":"D1-p164","passage":"D1-p164","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-166","set":"D1","n":166,"part":7,"q":"Which product saw the largest increase in shipments?","options":["Portable crushing machinery","Portable drilling rigs","Mineral-processing equipment","All mining machinery and related equipment"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Hàng portable crushing ... tăng 25%, lớn nhất bảng.","group":"D1-p164","passage":"D1-p164","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D1-167","set":"D1","n":167,"part":7,"q":"Who is sponsoring this event?","options":["U.S. Department of Commerce","City of Moscow","Oil & gas industry","NGJ International"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “NGJ International”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D1-p167","passage":"D1-p167","con