es the picture.","options":["He's cleaning the window with rags.","He's walking through the door.","He's holding several bags.","He's shopping inside the store."],"answer":"C","explanation":"Script từ audio Track 1 · Đáp án C. Đáp án này được ghi chú sẵn trong file PDF gốc; các lựa chọn còn lại phải nghe audio.","group":"5","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-006","set":"D2","n":6,"part":1,"q":"Listen and choose the statement that best describes the picture.","options":["The girl is laughing.","She can't stop coughing.","They're filing their papers.","Their cups are broken."],"answer":"A","explanation":"Script từ audio Track 1 · Đáp án A. Đáp án này được ghi chú sẵn trong file PDF gốc; các lựa chọn còn lại phải nghe audio.","group":"6","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-007","set":"D2","n":7,"part":1,"q":"Listen and choose the statement that best describes the picture.","options":["He's buying a round-trip ticket.","He's on his way to court.","He's going to pack his bags.","He's walking through the airport."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Script từ audio Track 1 · Đáp án D. Đáp án này được ghi chú sẵn trong file PDF gốc; các lựa chọn còn lại phải nghe audio.","group":"7","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-008","set":"D2","n":8,"part":1,"q":"Listen and choose the statement that best describes the picture.","options":["Their hats are in their hands.","One man is pointing at something.","The phone is on the desk.","They're painting one of the buildings."],"answer":"B","explanation":"Script từ audio Track 1 · Đáp án B. Đáp án này được ghi chú sẵn trong file PDF gốc; các lựa chọn còn lại phải nghe audio.","group":"8","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-009","set":"D2","n":9,"part":1,"q":"Listen and choose the statement that best describes the picture.","options":["He's walking home.","He's dialing a number.","He's talking on the phone.","He's cooking a meal."],"answer":"C","explanation":"Script từ audio Track 1 · Đáp án C. Đáp án này được ghi chú sẵn trong file PDF gốc; các lựa chọn còn lại phải nghe audio.","group":"9","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-010","set":"D2","n":10,"part":1,"q":"Listen and choose the statement that best describes the picture.","options":["They’re having a conference.","Listen to statement B","Listen to statement C","Listen to statement D"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Đáp án này được ghi chú sẵn trong file PDF gốc; các lựa chọn còn lại phải nghe audio.","group":"10","passage":null,"confidence":"partial"},{"id":"D2-011","set":"D2","n":11,"part":2,"q":"Who was that on the phone?","options":["It's mine.","It was my boss.","It was on the desk."],"answer":"B","explanation":"B: It was my boss. – trả lời đúng câu hỏi 'ai gọi'.","group":"11","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-012","set":"D2","n":12,"part":2,"q":"Let's take our lunch hour now.","options":["Great idea. I'm starving.","I take an hour for lunch.","I usually have it at a restaurant."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: Great idea. I'm starving. – đồng ý với đề nghị.","group":"12","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-013","set":"D2","n":13,"part":2,"q":"When is this report due?","options":["We import our supplies.","Yes, there are two.","At the end of the week."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: At the end of the week. – trả lời câu hỏi về thời hạn.","group":"13","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-014","set":"D2","n":14,"part":2,"q":"Where's the bank?","options":["I'll give it back.","Thank you very much.","It's right across the street."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: It's right across the street. – trả lời câu hỏi về vị trí.","group":"14","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-015","set":"D2","n":15,"part":2,"q":"Which car is yours?","options":["It's the small blue one over there.","It isn't very far away.","It was an interesting tour."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: It's the small blue one over there. – chỉ ra xe của mình.","group":"15","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-016","set":"D2","n":16,"part":2,"q":"Why did John leave early?","options":["Nobody leave the room.","He had an urgent appointment.","It's still early."],"answer":"B","explanation":"B: He had an urgent appointment. – giải thích lý do.","group":"16","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-017","set":"D2","n":17,"part":2,"q":"How was the movie?","options":["It was really boring.","We got the tickets online.","Just move everything over there."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: It was really boring. – nhận xét về bộ phim.","group":"17","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-018","set":"D2","n":18,"part":2,"q":"Could you help me copy these documents?","options":["I don't enjoy shopping.","I signed the documents.","I'm sorry, I'm too busy right now."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: I'm sorry, I'm too busy right now. – từ chối lịch sự.","group":"18","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-019","set":"D2","n":19,"part":2,"q":"Whose coat is this?","options":["It's in the closet.","It belongs to Mary.","It's a nice coat."],"answer":"B","explanation":"B: It belongs to Mary. – chỉ ra chủ nhân.","group":"19","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-020","set":"D2","n":20,"part":2,"q":"Will you have some coffee?","options":["I can't stop coughing.","No thank you, I'd prefer tea.","The cups are in the kitchen."],"answer":"B","explanation":"B: No thank you, I'd prefer tea. – từ chối lịch sự.","group":"20","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-021","set":"D2","n":21,"part":2,"q":"Which seat would you prefer?","options":["I rarely eat meat.","It's not a comfortable chair.","I'll take this one by the window."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: I'll take this one by the window. – chọn chỗ ngồi.","group":"21","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-022","set":"D2","n":22,"part":2,"q":"How long does it take to get there?","options":["Only about an hour or so.","I long to see them.","They make delicious cake there."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: Only about an hour or so. – trả lời câu hỏi về thời gian di chuyển.","group":"22","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-023","set":"D2","n":23,"part":2,"q":"What did you do with the package?","options":["I put it on your desk.","It wasn't a heavy package.","They were packing all night."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: I put it on your desk. – báo cáo nơi đặt gói hàng.","group":"23","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-024","set":"D2","n":24,"part":2,"q":"Will you be at the meeting?","options":["We enjoyed eating there.","It wasn't a long meeting.","Yes, but I'll probably arrive late."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: Yes, but I'll probably arrive late. – xác nhận có mặt nhưng trễ.","group":"24","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-025","set":"D2","n":25,"part":2,"q":"Where can I find printer ink?","options":["I think about it too.","It's on the top shelf of that closet.","The printer is very efficient."],"answer":"B","explanation":"B: It's on the top shelf of that closet. – chỉ vị trí mực in.","group":"25","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-026","set":"D2","n":26,"part":2,"q":"I'm really tired of this rainy weather.","options":["It's supposed to be sunny tomorrow.","Yes, train rides can be tiring.","This jacket is genuine leather."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: It's supposed to be sunny tomorrow. – an ủi bằng dự báo thời tiết.","group":"26","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-027","set":"D2","n":27,"part":2,"q":"Who signed these papers?","options":["I signed them.","You can buy the newspaper downstairs.","That sign says stop."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: I signed them. – trả lời trực tiếp câu hỏi ai ký.","group":"27","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-028","set":"D2","n":28,"part":2,"q":"Is the photocopy machine still broken?","options":["I'll make the copies later.","Yes, he's already spoken.","No, it was repaired this morning."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: No, it was repaired this morning. – thông báo máy đã sửa xong.","group":"28","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-029","set":"D2","n":29,"part":2,"q":"I need a ride to the airport.","options":["I can drive you.","The plane arrives at noon.","It's beside the airport."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: I can drive you. – đề nghị đưa đi.","group":"29","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-030","set":"D2","n":30,"part":2,"q":"What time is it now?","options":["We had a good time.","I'm fine, thank you.","It's just after 10."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: It's just after 10. – trả lời đúng câu hỏi về giờ.","group":"30","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-031","set":"D2","n":31,"part":2,"q":"Which suit should I wear?","options":["I don't care for fruit.","Wear this one.","I don't know where it is."],"answer":"B","explanation":"B: Wear this one. – gợi ý bộ đồ nên mặc.","group":"31","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-032","set":"D2","n":32,"part":2,"q":"Whose car is that parked by the front door?","options":["I believe it's John's.","It's a really old car.","The park isn't far."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: I believe it's John's. – xác định chủ xe.","group":"32","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-033","set":"D2","n":33,"part":2,"q":"When is the conference?","options":["It's not my preference.","It's at a hotel.","It's next September."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: It's next September. – trả lời câu hỏi về thời gian hội nghị.","group":"33","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-034","set":"D2","n":34,"part":2,"q":"Why did you go to the office on Saturday?","options":["I go to the office by bus.","Yes, I'll see you on Saturday.","I had a lot of work to do."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: I had a lot of work to do. – giải thích lý do.","group":"34","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-035","set":"D2","n":35,"part":2,"q":"This is your desk, isn't it?","options":["Yes, it's a desk.","No, mine's the one by the door.","We each have our own desk."],"answer":"B","explanation":"B: No, mine's the one by the door. – chỉ ra bàn đúng của mình.","group":"35","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-036","set":"D2","n":36,"part":2,"q":"What can you see from that window?","options":["A great view of the city.","It's very windy.","The window cleaner comes tomorrow."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: A great view of the city. – mô tả cảnh nhìn từ cửa sổ.","group":"36","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-037","set":"D2","n":37,"part":2,"q":"Where can I get a quick lunch?","options":["There's a cafeteria on the first floor.","Pick one of these.","It has a nice crunch."],"answer":"A","explanation":"A: There's a cafeteria on the first floor. – chỉ nơi ăn trưa nhanh.","group":"37","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-038","set":"D2","n":38,"part":2,"q":"How long are they planning to stay?","options":["It was a short plane ride.","They're staying at a hotel.","Three or four days at the most."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: Three or four days at the most. – trả lời về độ dài thời gian lưu trú.","group":"38","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-039","set":"D2","n":39,"part":2,"q":"Did you hear about the accident on the highway?","options":["Yes, I saw it on the news.","I heard it was a long highway.","I heard the news report this morning."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: I heard the news report this morning. – xác nhận đã nghe tin.","group":"39","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-040","set":"D2","n":40,"part":2,"q":"It's quite chilly outside.","options":["I think it's right outside.","It's a hilly area.","Then I'll put on an extra sweater."],"answer":"C","explanation":"C: Then I'll put on an extra sweater. – phản ứng hợp lý với thời tiết lạnh.","group":"40","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D2-041","set":"D2","n":41,"part":3,"q":"When was the phone call made?","options":["Two minutes ago","A few minutes ago","At 4:00","Before noon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Cuộc gọi diễn ra a few minutes ago.","group":"D2-listen-0","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-042","set":"D2","n":42,"part":3,"q":"Who called?","options":["The man's boss","The woman's assistant","The accountant","The budget director"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Người gọi là sếp của người đàn ông.","group":"D2-listen-0","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-043","set":"D2","n":43,"part":3,"q":"Why did this person call?","options":["To discuss the budget","To announce a salary raise","To ask the man to go to work early","To go over the accounts"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Sếp yêu cầu anh ấy đi làm sớm.","group":"D2-listen-0","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-044","set":"D2","n":44,"part":3,"q":"Where does this conversation take place?","options":["At a country club","At a restaurant","At a gym","At a hotel"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Số phòng 220; đây là khách sạn.","group":"D2-listen-1","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-045","set":"D2","n":45,"part":3,"q":"How much will the woman pay?","options":["$65","$155","$165","$220"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Giá phòng $165/đêm.","group":"D2-listen-1","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-046","set":"D2","n":46,"part":3,"q":"What will the woman do now?","options":["Read a book","Look at the room","Play tennis","Eat something"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Cô ấy xem phòng trước.","group":"D2-listen-1","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-047","set":"D2","n":47,"part":3,"q":"Where is Mr. Wing now?","options":["On vacation","At a meeting","On a business trip","At the train station"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Ông Wing đang đi nghỉ.","group":"D2-listen-2","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-048","set":"D2","n":48,"part":3,"q":"When will he return to the office?","options":["Tomorrow","On Friday","Next week","In three weeks"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Ông ấy về vào tuần sau.","group":"D2-listen-2","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-049","set":"D2","n":49,"part":3,"q":"Who will help the woman with her project?","options":["The man","Her boss","Mr. Wing","Mr. Wing’s assistant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Assistant của Mr. Wing sẽ giúp dự án.","group":"D2-listen-2","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-050","set":"D2","n":50,"part":3,"q":"What is the man's complaint?","options":["He didn't see any art.","The tickets were expensive.","The hotel is far away.","The museum is closed at night."],"answer":"B","explanation":"Người đàn ông phàn nàn vé bảo tàng đắt.","group":"D2-listen-3","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-051","set":"D2","n":51,"part":3,"q":"What time is it now?","options":["3:00","4:00","9:00","10:00"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Người phụ nữ nói it is only 3:00.","group":"D2-listen-3","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-052","set":"D2","n":52,"part":3,"q":"What will they do now?","options":["Work","Go to the hotel","Park the car","Eat something"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Họ định ăn nhẹ trước.","group":"D2-listen-3","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-053","set":"D2","n":53,"part":3,"q":"How is the weather today?","options":["Cloudy","Rainy","Sunny","Icy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Hôm nay nắng đẹp.","group":"D2-listen-4","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-054","set":"D2","n":54,"part":3,"q":"What are the speakers doing?","options":["Working","Walking","Taking the train","Going to the store"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Hai người đang đi bộ.","group":"D2-listen-4","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-055","set":"D2","n":55,"part":3,"q":"When will the weather change?","options":["Tomorrow","In two days","On the weekend","In a week"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Ngày mai trời lại mưa.","group":"D2-listen-4","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-056","set":"D2","n":56,"part":3,"q":"Why is the woman late?","options":["She didn't have the bus fare.","She had to walk to the bus stop.","She missed the bus.","The bus was delayed."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Xe buýt bị trễ vì thời tiết.","group":"D2-listen-5","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-057","set":"D2","n":57,"part":3,"q":"How does the man get to work?","options":["Bus","Car","Subway","Walking"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Người đàn ông đi tàu điện ngầm.","group":"D2-listen-5","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-058","set":"D2","n":58,"part":3,"q":"How much is the bus fare?","options":["$1.50","$2.00","$2.50","$4.00"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Vé xe buýt $2.50.","group":"D2-listen-5","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-059","set":"D2","n":59,"part":3,"q":"Where does the man want to go?","options":["A restaurant","A grocery store","A post office","A bank"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Người đàn ông muốn ăn ở nhà hàng.","group":"D2-listen-6","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-060","set":"D2","n":60,"part":3,"q":"How many blocks away is it?","options":["One","Two","Three","Four"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Nhà hàng cách hai block.","group":"D2-listen-6","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-061","set":"D2","n":61,"part":3,"q":"What time is it now?","options":["1:00","Just before 1:30","Just after 1:30","2:00"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Lúc đó gần 1:30.","group":"D2-listen-6","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-062","set":"D2","n":62,"part":3,"q":"Why did the man leave his old job?","options":["He didn't get enough vacation time.","It wasn't close to home.","The work was too slow.","The pay was too low."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Anh ấy nghỉ vì lương cũ quá thấp.","group":"D2-listen-7","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-063","set":"D2","n":63,"part":3,"q":"How does he feel about his new job?","options":["Happy","Unsure","Bad","Sad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Anh ấy hài lòng với công việc mới.","group":"D2-listen-7","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-064","set":"D2","n":64,"part":3,"q":"How many weeks of vacation does he get?","options":["One","Two","Three","Six"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Ba tuần nghỉ phép mỗi năm.","group":"D2-listen-7","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-065","set":"D2","n":65,"part":3,"q":"Where are the speakers going?","options":["A park","A garage","The office","The theater"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Họ đi xem kịch.","group":"D2-listen-8","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-066","set":"D2","n":66,"part":3,"q":"What time does the man want to leave?","options":["10:00","5:45","6:15","9:00"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Muốn đi lúc 5:45 do giờ cao điểm.","group":"D2-listen-8","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-067","set":"D2","n":67,"part":3,"q":"Where will they go later?","options":["A restaurant","A party","A game","Home"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Xem xong về thẳng nhà.","group":"D2-listen-8","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-068","set":"D2","n":68,"part":3,"q":"What does the man want to drink?","options":["Coffee","Hot tea","Iced tea","Water"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Anh ấy xin nước.","group":"D2-listen-9","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-069","set":"D2","n":69,"part":3,"q":"How does the man feel?","options":["Thirsty","Tired","Hungry","Angry"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Anh ấy rất khát.","group":"D2-listen-9","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-070","set":"D2","n":70,"part":3,"q":"What does the woman offer the man?","options":["A book","Some cake","Some magazines","A ride"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Cô ấy mời anh ấy ăn bánh.","group":"D2-listen-9","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-071","set":"D2","n":71,"part":4,"q":"What time will the flight to Caracas leave?","options":["2:00","3:00","5:00","7:00"],"answer":"D","explanation":"5:00 bị hoãn 2 giờ => 7:00.","group":"D2-listen-10","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-072","set":"D2","n":72,"part":4,"q":"What is offered to the passengers?","options":["A free meal","A book","A suitcase","A refund check"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Hãng mời hành khách một bữa ăn miễn phí.","group":"D2-listen-10","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-073","set":"D2","n":73,"part":4,"q":"How can passengers take advantage of the offer?","options":["Board the plane","Talk to the gate agent","Wait in the lounge","Go to the baggage claim area"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Xuất trình boarding pass cho gate agent.","group":"D2-listen-10","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-074","set":"D2","n":74,"part":4,"q":"What place is opening?","options":["A garden","An office","A store","An apartment"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Mayflower là cửa hàng bách hóa.","group":"D2-listen-11","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-075","set":"D2","n":75,"part":4,"q":"When will the opening take place?","options":["Sunday","Monday","Friday","Saturday"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Grand opening next Saturday.","group":"D2-listen-11","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-076","set":"D2","n":76,"part":4,"q":"Where is this place?","options":["Next to the train station","Downtown","Beside a park","Across from a mall"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Across the road from City Mall.","group":"D2-listen-11","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-077","set":"D2","n":77,"part":4,"q":"What is the weather like?","options":["Rainy","Snowy","Sunny","Warm"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Tuyết rơi.","group":"D2-listen-12","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-078","set":"D2","n":78,"part":4,"q":"How many cars were in the accident?","options":["2","5","7","11"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Seven-car accident.","group":"D2-listen-12","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-079","set":"D2","n":79,"part":4,"q":"When will the weather change?","options":["This morning","In the afternoon","In the evening","Tomorrow"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Ngày mai trời quang.","group":"D2-listen-12","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-080","set":"D2","n":80,"part":4,"q":"What are the tickets for?","options":["A play","A circus","A movie","A TV show"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Vé xem circus.","group":"D2-listen-13","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-081","set":"D2","n":81,"part":4,"q":"How much do the tickets cost?","options":["$15","$16","$37","$50"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Giá $15.","group":"D2-listen-13","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-082","set":"D2","n":82,"part":4,"q":"How can you get a free ticket?","options":["Go to the theater","Send a postcard","Make a phone call","Visit a website"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Gửi postcard để xin vé miễn phí.","group":"D2-listen-13","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-083","set":"D2","n":83,"part":4,"q":"What was destroyed by a fire?","options":["A tool shed","A park","A school","A bookstore"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Một trường học bị cháy.","group":"D2-listen-14","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-084","set":"D2","n":84,"part":4,"q":"What time was the fire reported?","options":["4:00","5:00","7:00","9:00"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Khoảng 9:00 người báo tin phát hiện khói.","group":"D2-listen-14","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-085","set":"D2","n":85,"part":4,"q":"Who was hurt in the fire?","options":["Ethel Rogers","A firefighter","Some children","No one"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Không ai bị thương.","group":"D2-listen-14","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-086","set":"D2","n":86,"part":4,"q":"When can passengers get on the train?","options":["In 3 minutes","In 5 minutes","In 6 minutes","In 10 minutes"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Boarding in three minutes.","group":"D2-listen-15","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-087","set":"D2","n":87,"part":4,"q":"What must passengers have to get on the train?","options":["An information form","A passport","A reservation","A first-class ticket"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Chỉ hành khách đặt chỗ trước được lên.","group":"D2-listen-15","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-088","set":"D2","n":88,"part":4,"q":"What are passengers not allowed to take on the train?","options":["Photographs","Two or more carry-on bags","Coats and purses","Meat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Chỉ được mang một kiện hành lý xách tay.","group":"D2-listen-15","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-089","set":"D2","n":89,"part":4,"q":"How long does the radio program last?","options":["15 minutes","45 minutes","1 hour","2 hours"],"answer":"B","explanation":"1:15 to 2:00 = 45 minutes.","group":"D2-listen-16","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-090","set":"D2","n":90,"part":4,"q":"What will Dr. Silva talk about?","options":["Office workers' health and fitness problems","The importance of business clothes that fit","How to give business talks","Writing books"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Dr. Silva nói về sức khỏe nhân viên văn phòng.","group":"D2-listen-16","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-091","set":"D2","n":91,"part":4,"q":"What will Dr. Silva do after his talk?","options":["Answer questions","Ask questions","Read the news","Go to the bank"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Sau talk, khách mời trả lời điện thoại thính giả.","group":"D2-listen-16","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-092","set":"D2","n":92,"part":4,"q":"What did the president do this afternoon?","options":["Flew in a plane","Watched TV","Gave a speech","Had a meeting"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Tổng thống họp với lãnh đạo.","group":"D2-listen-17","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-093","set":"D2","n":93,"part":4,"q":"Where will the president go tomorrow?","options":["The capital city","Tokyo","Australia","Home"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Ngày mai bay đến Tokyo.","group":"D2-listen-17","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-094","set":"D2","n":94,"part":4,"q":"How long will his trip last?","options":["2 weeks","3 weeks","1 month","4 months"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Chuyến công du kéo dài ba tuần.","group":"D2-listen-17","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-095","set":"D2","n":95,"part":4,"q":"At which one of the following times is the bank open?","options":["Monday at 8:30 AM","Tuesday at 9:30 AM","Friday at 5:30 PM","Saturday at 4:30 PM"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Giờ mở cửa thứ ba 9:00–16:30.","group":"D2-listen-18","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-096","set":"D2","n":96,"part":4,"q":"How can a customer find out the balance of his savings account?","options":["Press 1","Press 2","Press 3","Press 4"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Press 1 cho tài khoản hiện tại.","group":"D2-listen-18","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-097","set":"D2","n":97,"part":4,"q":"What happens when a customer presses 0?","options":["She can open a new account.","She can apply for a loan.","She can get a credit card.","She can hear the message again."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Press zero để nghe lại menu.","group":"D2-listen-18","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-098","set":"D2","n":98,"part":4,"q":"According to the speaker, what is the best place to look for a job?","options":["Career counseling offices","Employment agencies","The Internet","Newspapers"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Tác giả nêu Internet là nơi tốt nhất.","group":"D2-listen-19","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-099","set":"D2","n":99,"part":4,"q":"What kinds of jobs can be found in this place?","options":["Educational jobs only","Medical jobs only","Engineering jobs only","Any kind of job"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Có công việc thuộc mọi lĩnh vực.","group":"D2-listen-19","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-100","set":"D2","n":100,"part":4,"q":"According to the speaker, what is a job seeker's most important tool?","options":["A resume","A degree","Interview skills","Work experience"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Resume là công cụ quan trọng nhất.","group":"D2-listen-19","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-101","set":"D2","n":101,"part":5,"q":"When Ms. Song gets here, we ______ the meeting.","options":["start","will start","have started","are starting"],"answer":"B","explanation":"When + hiện tại đơn (gets), mệnh đề chính chỉ tương lai dùng will + V.","group":"101","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-102","set":"D2","n":102,"part":5,"q":"Don't forget to sign the application form _______ you submit it.","options":["while","after","as soon as","before"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Before + mệnh đề: phải ký trước khi nộp đơn.","group":"102","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-103","set":"D2","n":103,"part":5,"q":"The final report should be sent______ the company's main office before the end of the month.","options":["in","to","on","for"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Send something to an office/person: gửi đến nơi nhận.","group":"103","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-104","set":"D2","n":104,"part":5,"q":"All employees ________ to attend next Friday's staff meeting.","options":["encourage","will encourage","are encouraged","are encouraging"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Are encouraged to + V: bị động hiện tại của encourage, được khuyến khích.","group":"104","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-105","set":"D2","n":105,"part":5,"q":"We_________ each staff member to do his or her part to get this project completed on time.","options":["expect","expel","expend","expedite"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Expect somebody to do something: kỳ vọng ai làm gì.","group":"105","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-106","set":"D2","n":106,"part":5,"q":"The association conference will take place ______ December.","options":["in","on","at","of"],"answer":"A","explanation":"In + tháng (in December); on + thứ/ngày.","group":"106","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-107","set":"D2","n":107,"part":5,"q":"Mr. Lutz is _____ to take on such a big responsibility because he doesn't feel prepared for it at this time.","options":["relieved","reluctant","reliable","relocated"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Reluctant to + V: miễn cưỡng/không sẵn sàng nhận trách nhiệm.","group":"107","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-108","set":"D2","n":108,"part":5,"q":"The current _____ of this office plans to leave before the end of the month.","options":["occupancy","occupying","occupy","occupant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Occupant (n): người đang sử dụng phòng/cơ sở; chỉ người chứ không phải trạng thái.","group":"108","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-109","set":"D2","n":109,"part":5,"q":"We are looking for ways to reduce expenses _______ our financial situation is not good.","options":["although","but","because","or"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Because + mệnh đề chỉ nguyên nhân: vì tình hình tài chính không tốt.","group":"109","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-110","set":"D2","n":110,"part":5,"q":"The office closes ______ noon on Saturdays.","options":["at","on","in","to"],"answer":"A","explanation":"At noon: vào giữa trưa; at chỉ mốc giờ.","group":"110","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-111","set":"D2","n":111,"part":5,"q":"The director says that she ________ to hire several new staff members next year.","options":["plan","plans","planning","planned"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Ngôi thứ ba số ít she + plans; plan to + V.","group":"111","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-112","set":"D2","n":112,"part":5,"q":"Mr. Chan______ in charge of operations since the beginning of last year.","options":["is","was","has been","will be"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Since + mốc thời gian → hiện tại hoàn thành has been.","group":"112","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-113","set":"D2","n":113,"part":5,"q":"Replacement cartridges for the printer can be found _____ the top shelf of the supply closet.","options":["on","in","at","between"],"answer":"A","explanation":"On the top shelf: trên kệ cao nhất.","group":"113","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-114","set":"D2","n":114,"part":5,"q":"Both lunch ______ dinner are served in the company cafeteria.","options":["or","either","but","and"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Both A and B: cả bữa trưa và bữa tối.","group":"114","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-115","set":"D2","n":115,"part":5,"q":"Requests for extra time off must _______ by the employee’s supervisor.","options":["approve","be approved","be approving","approval"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Must be + V3: thể bị động sau modal, yêu cầu phải được phê duyệt.","group":"115","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-116","set":"D2","n":116,"part":5,"q":"The board of directors agreed _____ Ms. Silva’s contract for another year.","options":["renew","to renew","renewing","will renew"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Agree to + V: đồng ý làm việc gì; renew a contract = gia hạn hợp đồng.","group":"116","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-117","set":"D2","n":117,"part":5,"q":"It is important to dress _______when going on a job interview.","options":["profess","profession","professional","professionally"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Dress professionally: trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho động từ dress.","group":"117","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-118","set":"D2","n":118,"part":5,"q":"Ms. Toth slipped and fell _______ she was walking on the icy sidewalk in front of the building.","options":["while","during","although","but"],"answer":"A","explanation":"While + mệnh đề thời gian; during + danh từ, nên không dùng during she was walking.","group":"118","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-119","set":"D2","n":119,"part":5,"q":"We prohibit______ in any part of the building or grounds.","options":["smoke","to smoke","smoking","will smoke"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Prohibit + V-ing: cấm hành vi; prohibit smoking.","group":"119","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-120","set":"D2","n":120,"part":5,"q":"All packages, bags, and bundles will be ______ by a security officer before leaving the building.","options":["respected","inspected","prospected","suspected"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Be inspected by a security officer: bị động, được kiểm tra an ninh.","group":"120","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-121","set":"D2","n":121,"part":5,"q":"The new office is _______ 151 North Main Street.","options":["on","at","in","for"],"answer":"B","explanation":"At + địa chỉ nhà cụ thể; on + tên đường khi không có số nhà.","group":"121","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-122","set":"D2","n":122,"part":5,"q":"We are concerned _____ the high rate of absenteeism among our employees.","options":["on","for","about","of"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Concerned about: lo lắng về.","group":"122","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-123","set":"D2","n":123,"part":5,"q":"The new building will be dedicated _____ June 30.","options":["on","in","at","to"],"answer":"A","explanation":"On + ngày cụ thể (on June 30).","group":"123","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-124","set":"D2","n":124,"part":5,"q":"The rent on this office is _________ than the rent we have been paying at our old place.","options":["high","higher","highly","highest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Higher than: so sánh hơn tính từ ngắn + -er + than.","group":"124","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-125","set":"D2","n":125,"part":5,"q":"__________ we were careful with expenses, we still went over our budget this year.","options":["If","Since","Because","Even though"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Even though + clause: mặc dù; tương phản giữa cẩn thận và vượt ngân sách.","group":"125","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-126","set":"D2","n":126,"part":5,"q":"She delayed ______ the contract until she had a chance to speak with her attorney.","options":["sign","signing","to sign","signature"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Delay + V-ing: trì hoãn việc ký kết.","group":"126","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-127","set":"D2","n":127,"part":5,"q":"The woman ______ rents this office uses it only a few days a month.","options":["who's","whose","who","whom"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Who làm chủ ngữ mệnh đề quan hệ, thay cho the woman.","group":"127","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-128","set":"D2","n":128,"part":5,"q":"If your passport is no longer _______ , then you should use some other form of identification.","options":["valid","validate","validating","validation"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Valid (adjective): còn hiệu lực; sau is cần tính từ.","group":"128","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-129","set":"D2","n":129,"part":5,"q":"He _______ about that issue for last month’s report.","options":["writes","wrote","is writing","written"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Last month chỉ quá khứ hoàn thành → wrote (quá khứ đơn).","group":"129","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-130","set":"D2","n":130,"part":5,"q":"____________ your supervisor if you plan to be away from the office for any length of time during the day.","options":["Notify","Notifying","Should notify","Will notify"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Notify your supervisor: câu mệnh lệnh bắt đầu bằng nguyên mẫu.","group":"130","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-131","set":"D2","n":131,"part":5,"q":"Mr. Carlo was very upset when he learned that he had been passed ______ for the promotion.","options":["in","out","over","through"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Be passed over for promotion: bị bỏ qua trong đợt thăng chức.","group":"131","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-132","set":"D2","n":132,"part":5,"q":"We have spent too much money and will have to _______ for the rest of the year.","options":["economy","economize","economist","economically"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Economize (V): tiết kiệm; sau have to + V.","group":"132","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-133","set":"D2","n":133,"part":5,"q":"Time is short and we will have to work very hard to ______ our goals by the end of the year.","options":["perceive","receive","conceive","achieve"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Achieve goals: đạt mục tiêu; collocation cố định.","group":"133","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-134","set":"D2","n":134,"part":5,"q":"You can choose to have your paycheck mailed to you, ________ you can have your salary deposited directly into your bank account.","options":["or","if","but","so"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Or nối hai phương án chọn nhận lương qua thư hoặc gửi vào tài khoản.","group":"134","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-135","set":"D2","n":135,"part":5,"q":"This building, ________ was built more than 100 years ago, is scheduled for demolition next month.","options":["it","that","was","which"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Which trong mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định sau dấu phẩy.","group":"135","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-136","set":"D2","n":136,"part":5,"q":"If you _______ your application tomorrow, you will still be eligible for the job.","options":["to submit","submitted","submit","submits"],"answer":"C","explanation":"If + present simple, will + V: điều kiện loại 1; if you submit.","group":"136","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-137","set":"D2","n":137,"part":5,"q":"We _______ in the elevator when the electricity went out, and we were stuck there for almost an hour.","options":["rode","were riding","ridden","had ridden"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Were riding (past continuous) khi điện bị cắt (past simple).","group":"137","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-138","set":"D2","n":138,"part":5,"q":"You must _______ every item on the form or your application will not be considered.","options":["complete","to complete","completing","will complete"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Must + V nguyên mẫu: phải hoàn tất.","group":"138","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-139","set":"D2","n":139,"part":5,"q":"We feel _______ about coming to an agreement on the issue soon.","options":["hoping","hopeful","hopefully","to hope"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Feel hopeful about + V-ing: cảm thấy lạc quan về.","group":"139","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-140","set":"D2","n":140,"part":5,"q":"______________ in today's business world is difficult, and many new businesses fail.","options":["Compete","To compete","Competing","Have competed"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Competing (gerund) làm chủ ngữ của câu; động từ theo sau is.","group":"140","passage":null,"confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-141","set":"D2","n":141,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 141 in the passage.","options":["attire","transportation","schedules","attitudes"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Inappropriate attire: trang phục không phù hợp.","group":"D2-p141","passage":"D2-p141","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-142","set":"D2","n":142,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 142 in the passage.","options":["wear","worn","be wearing","be worn"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Should not be worn: bị động sau modal should.","group":"D2-p141","passage":"D2-p141","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-143","set":"D2","n":143,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 143 in the passage.","options":["I","him","you","me"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Let me know: hãy cho tôi biết.","group":"D2-p141","passage":"D2-p141","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-144","set":"D2","n":144,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 144 in the passage.","options":["vacant","relaxed","hectic","dull"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Hectic: bận rộn, tất bật (ngược vacant, dull).","group":"D2-p144","passage":"D2-p144","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-145","set":"D2","n":145,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 145 in the passage.","options":["so","if","because","although"],"answer":"B","explanation":"If + present simple, can + V: điều kiện có thật.","group":"D2-p144","passage":"D2-p144","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-146","set":"D2","n":146,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 146 in the passage.","options":["Climb","Climbs","Climbing","To climb"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Climbing stairs (gerund) làm chủ ngữ.","group":"D2-p144","passage":"D2-p144","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-147","set":"D2","n":147,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 147 in the passage.","options":["advice","adversity","advertising","advancement"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Opportunities for advancement: cơ hội thăng tiến.","group":"D2-p147","passage":"D2-p147","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-148","set":"D2","n":148,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 148 in the passage.","options":["applicant","application","to apply","apply"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Welcome your application: tiếp nhận đơn ứng tuyển.","group":"D2-p147","passage":"D2-p147","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-149","set":"D2","n":149,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 149 in the passage.","options":["have","will have","had","have had"],"answer":"A","explanation":"When + present simple trong mệnh đề thời gian tương lai.","group":"D2-p147","passage":"D2-p147","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-150","set":"D2","n":150,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 150 in the passage.","options":["accounting","banking","catering","organizing"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Catering service: dịch vụ phục vụ tiệc/bữa ăn.","group":"D2-p150","passage":"D2-p150","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-151","set":"D2","n":151,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 151 in the passage.","options":["them","they","he","it"],"answer":"B","explanation":"They thay danh từ số nhiều conference rooms.","group":"D2-p150","passage":"D2-p150","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-152","set":"D2","n":152,"part":6,"q":"Choose the best word or phrase to complete blank 152 in the passage.","options":["appreciate","appreciative","appreciation","appreciated"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Would appreciate + noun: trân trọng ý kiến.","group":"D2-p150","passage":"D2-p150","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-153","set":"D2","n":153,"part":7,"q":"Who would be interested in this ad?","options":["Business owners","Investment advisers","Homeowners","Newspaper reporters"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Business owners fiv”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p153","passage":"D2-p153","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-154","set":"D2","n":154,"part":7,"q":"What would be the cost to run a 10-line ad for five days?","options":["$.50","$2.50","$5.00","$25.00"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Quảng cáo giá $0.50 mỗi dòng mỗi ngày; 10 dòng × 5 ngày × $0.50 = $25.","group":"D2-p153","passage":"D2-p153","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-155","set":"D2","n":155,"part":7,"q":"How often does the meeting take place?","options":["Once a week","Once a month","Once a year","Twice a year"],"answer":"C","explanation":"“Each November” nghĩa là tổ chức mỗi năm một lần.","group":"D2-p155","passage":"D2-p155","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-156","set":"D2","n":156,"part":7,"q":"Who will participate in the discussion?","options":["Researchers","Business leaders","The governor","Hotel administrators"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Bài báo nêu business and political leaders.","group":"D2-p155","passage":"D2-p155","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-157","set":"D2","n":157,"part":7,"q":"What will happen right after the luncheon?","options":["The discussion will continue.","There will be a speaker.","Everyone will go home.","Members will call the Business and Industry Association."],"answer":"B","explanation":"After luncheon, Dr. Pleasance will address audience.","group":"D2-p155","passage":"D2-p155","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-158","set":"D2","n":158,"part":7,"q":"What is this form for?","options":["To apply for a credit card","To make a purchase","To report a billing error","To ask for a refund"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “To report a billing error”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p158","passage":"D2-p158","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-159","set":"D2","n":159,"part":7,"q":"What should Ms. Larsen enclose with the form?","options":["Payment","A sales receipt","An extra envelope","Defective merchandise"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “A sales receipt”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p158","passage":"D2-p158","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-160","set":"D2","n":160,"part":7,"q":"The word “examined” in line 7 is closest in meaning to","options":["paid","sent in","copied","looked at"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “copied.”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p158","passage":"D2-p158","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-161","set":"D2","n":161,"part":7,"q":"According to Ms. Larsen, how much should she pay?","options":["$15","$75","$115","$175"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Trong mẫu Helga Larsen nói khoản thực chi lúc mua là $75, khác $115 trên sao kê.","group":"D2-p158","passage":"D2-p158","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-162","set":"D2","n":162,"part":7,"q":"Why did Mr. Ungemach write to Ming & Associates?","options":["To order a product","To apply for a full-time job","To offer to help with a project","To develop his skills"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “To apply for a full-time job”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p162","passage":"D2-p162","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-163","set":"D2","n":163,"part":7,"q":"What does Ms. Knightly ask Mr. Ungemach to do?","options":["Send her his resume","Select a professional assignment","Notify her when he is available","Indicate his interest in a consulting position"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Select a professional assignment”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p162","passage":"D2-p162","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-164","set":"D2","n":164,"part":7,"q":"What is the purpose of this notice?","options":["To request an overdue payment","To explain charges on an electric bill","To clarify a national regulation","To offer a financial service"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “To offer a financial service”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p164","passage":"D2-p164","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-165","set":"D2","n":165,"part":7,"q":"If the customer pays before August 31, how much will he owe?","options":["$15","$85","$100","$150"],"answer":"C","explanation":"$85 tiền điện quá hạn + $15 phí chậm = $100; chưa tính phí nối điện $50 vì chưa bị ngắt.","group":"D2-p164","passage":"D2-p164","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-166","set":"D2","n":166,"part":7,"q":"How can the customer find out about financing?","options":["Read the other side of the notice","Call the Customer Service office","Study National Regulation #50504","Write to the power company"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Study National Regulation #50504”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p164","passage":"D2-p164","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-167","set":"D2","n":167,"part":7,"q":"The word “resume” in line 8 is closest in meaning to","options":["add to","improve","restart","cut off"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “improve.”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p164","passage":"D2-p164","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-168","set":"D2","n":168,"part":7,"q":"Who is not in favor of the new shopping mall?","options":["Local residents","The city council","A horse farmer","Mr. Smithson"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Local residents o”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p168","passage":"D2-p168","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-169","set":"D2","n":169,"part":7,"q":"Which one of the following things will customers NOT be able to do at the mall?","options":["Take a class","Buy a car","Watch a movie","See a doctor"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Buy a car”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p168","passage":"D2-p168","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-170","set":"D2","n":170,"part":7,"q":"How many cars will be able to park in the outdoor parking lot?","options":["250","500","750","1,500"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Bãi ngoài trời chứa ít nhất gấp đôi bãi ngầm 750 chỗ: 1.500 xe.","group":"D2-p168","passage":"D2-p168","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-171","set":"D2","n":171,"part":7,"q":"When will construction of the mall probably be completed?","options":["6 months from now","1 year from now","1½ years from now","4 years from now"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Bắt đầu sau 6 tháng và hoàn tất trong tối đa 1 năm: khoảng 1,5 năm từ hiện tại.","group":"D2-p168","passage":"D2-p168","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-172","set":"D2","n":172,"part":7,"q":"What kind of business is Pinkerton’s?","options":["Office supply store","Printing company","Furniture store","Photocopy service"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Office supply store”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p172","passage":"D2-p172","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-173","set":"D2","n":173,"part":7,"q":"How much would a customer spend for two ink cartridges?","options":["$15","$30","$45","$50"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Hộp mực thứ nhất $30, hộp thứ hai giảm 50% = $15; tổng $45.","group":"D2-p172","passage":"D2-p172","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-174","set":"D2","n":174,"part":7,"q":"What item is 25% off?","options":["Photocopier paper","Notebooks","Desks","Chairs"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Notebooks”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p172","passage":"D2-p172","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-175","set":"D2","n":175,"part":7,"q":"Why did Ms. Heinz write this letter?","options":["To advertise her business","To follow up on a consultation","To reply to Ms. Pavlis’s letter","To explain charges on a bill"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “To reply to Ms. Pavlis’s letter”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p175","passage":"D2-p175","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-176","set":"D2","n":176,"part":7,"q":"What does Ms. Pavlis want to do?","options":["Save money on heating and cooling","Construct a new building","Get new windows and doors","Repair her roof"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Save money on heating and cooling is”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p175","passage":"D2-p175","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-177","set":"D2","n":177,"part":7,"q":"How much will Ms. Pavlis pay if she gets the service as outlined in the letter?","options":["$175","$1,500","$1,575","$1,675"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “$1,500”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p175","passage":"D2-p175","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-178","set":"D2","n":178,"part":7,"q":"The word upgrades in paragraph 2, line 2 is closest in meaning to","options":["materials.","systems.","builders.","improvements."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “improvements.”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p175","passage":"D2-p175","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-179","set":"D2","n":179,"part":7,"q":"Who should apply for this job?","options":["A dentist","An accountant","A software engineer","A health care manager"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “An accountant”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p179","passage":"D2-p179","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-180","set":"D2","n":180,"part":7,"q":"How can someone apply for this job?","options":["Call the HR coordinator","Write a letter to the CFO","Send a resume to Ms. Santarelli","Visit the Magus Finance, Inc. office"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Send a resume to Ms. Santarelli”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p179","passage":"D2-p179","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-181","set":"D2","n":181,"part":7,"q":"What kind of services does Crisp Company offer?","options":["Law","Delivery","Phone and Internet","Accounting"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Hóa đơn có local phone, long distance phone, Internet services.","group":"D2-p181","passage":"D2-p181","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-182","set":"D2","n":182,"part":7,"q":"Why did Mr. Krumholz write the letter?","options":["He disagrees with a charge.","He forgot his account number.","He needs a copy of a check.","He requires more services."],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “He disagrees with a charge. (A”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p181","passage":"D2-p181","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-183","set":"D2","n":183,"part":7,"q":"What mistake did Mr. Krumholz make?","options":["He wrote the wrong amount on the check.","He didn't have enough money in the bank.","He added the figures incorrectly.","He sent in last month's payment late."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Ông gửi séc ngày 26/3, nhưng hóa đơn chỉ tính tiền nhận trước 25/3; lỗi là nộp trễ.","group":"D2-p181","passage":"D2-p181","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-184","set":"D2","n":184,"part":7,"q":"According to Mr. Krumholz, how much does he owe the company now?","options":["$50","$125","$132","$257"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Số cần trả bây giờ chỉ là các khoản tháng này: $132.","group":"D2-p181","passage":"D2-p181","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-185","set":"D2","n":185,"part":7,"q":"What will Mr. Krumholz do tomorrow?","options":["Contact his bank","Mail a check","Get a copy of a check","Write a letter to Crisp Company"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Write a letter to Crisp Company”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p181","passage":"D2-p181","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-186","set":"D2","n":186,"part":7,"q":"When will the workshop take place?","options":["June 10","June 11","June 12","June 17"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Email ngày Monday June 10 viết “day after tomorrow”: Wednesday June 12.","group":"D2-p186","passage":"D2-p186","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-187","set":"D2","n":187,"part":7,"q":"What time will tea and snacks be served?","options":["9:30","10:30","11:00","12:15"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Mr Chang bắt đầu 9:30, nói trong một giờ, tea and snacks sau đó → 10:30.","group":"D2-p186","passage":"D2-p186","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-188","set":"D2","n":188,"part":7,"q":"Where does Mr. Park want the lunch served?","options":["Room A","Room B","Room C","Room D"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Room C”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p186","passage":"D2-p186","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-189","set":"D2","n":189,"part":7,"q":"How many chairs should there be in each room?","options":["15","30","45","60"],"answer":"D","explanation":"45 người đã ghi danh + 15 ghế dự phòng = 60 ghế.","group":"D2-p186","passage":"D2-p186","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-190","set":"D2","n":190,"part":7,"q":"Who will present at 3:00?","options":["L. Chang","J. H. Lee","I. A. Kim","D. Wang"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Đổi J.H. Lee sang suất 3:00 do D.Wang phải rời đi sau trưa.","group":"D2-p186","passage":"D2-p186","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-191","set":"D2","n":191,"part":7,"q":"What is the maximum number of annual leave days a Howland employee can take?","options":["10","15","20","25"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “25”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p191","passage":"D2-p191","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-192","set":"D2","n":192,"part":7,"q":"How long has Daniel Ortiz probably worked at the Howland Corporation?","options":["No more than 2 years","At least 3 years","At least 6 years","More than 11 years"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “At least 3 years D”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p191","passage":"D2-p191","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-193","set":"D2","n":193,"part":7,"q":"What is the latest date Daniel Ortiz can submit this form?","options":["July 1","July 15","July 21","July 26"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “July 1”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p191","passage":"D2-p191","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-194","set":"D2","n":194,"part":7,"q":"Who has to sign the form?","options":["Daniel Ortiz","Daisy Ortega","Nestor Perez","Mr. Howland"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Nestor Perez”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p191","passage":"D2-p191","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-195","set":"D2","n":195,"part":7,"q":"Who is Daisy Ortega?","options":["President of the Howland Corporation","Head of the Research and Development Department","Human Resources Director","Daniel Ortiz’s assistant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Human Resources Director”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p191","passage":"D2-p191","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-196","set":"D2","n":196,"part":7,"q":"How big is Marilyn and Paul’s current office?","options":["450 square feet","750 square feet","900 square feet","1,750 square feet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “450 square feet cu”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p196","passage":"D2-p196","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-197","set":"D2","n":197,"part":7,"q":"What is true of Marilyn and Paul’s current office?","options":["It costs more than the advertised office.","It is near the subway.","It is in a building with an elevator.","It is in a 10-story building."],"answer":"B","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “It is near the subway. (B”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p196","passage":"D2-p196","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-198","set":"D2","n":198,"part":7,"q":"When does Paul want to see the office?","options":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “Wednesday”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p196","passage":"D2-p196","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-199","set":"D2","n":199,"part":7,"q":"What does the advertised office have that the current office doesn’t?","options":["A kitchen","A bathroom","A parking area","A reception area"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “A parking area”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p196","passage":"D2-p196","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D2-200","set":"D2","n":200,"part":7,"q":"How much would Marilyn and Paul have to pay before moving into the advertised office?","options":["$900","$1,750","$1,800","$3,500"],"answer":"D","explanation":"Từ khóa hoặc dữ kiện trong bài đọc dẫn đến lựa chọn “$ 3,500”. Nên đối chiếu trực tiếp câu chứa thông tin, tránh chọn đáp án có từ giống nhưng sai ý.","group":"D2-p196","passage":"D2-p196","confidence":"review"},{"id":"D3-001","set":"D3","n":1,"part":1,"q":"Which statement best describes the photograph?","options":["The conference is in session.","The movie is about to begin.","The concert hall is empty.","The attendees are standing."],"answer":"A","explanation":"Hình ảnh khớp câu mô tả về vị trí hoặc hành động.","group":"1","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D3-002","set":"D3","n":2,"part":1,"q":"Which statement best describes the photograph?","options":["They're sitting by the dock.","They're building the engine.","They're assembling the clocks.","They're walking through the facility."],"answer":"C","explanation":"Hình ảnh khớp câu mô tả về vị trí hoặc hành động.","group":"2","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D3-003","set":"D3","n":3,"part":1,"q":"Which statement best describes the photograph?","options":["The man is taking a nap.","The map is in the book.","The geography book is on the shelf.","The man is putting a pin in the map."],"answer":"D","explanation":"Hình ảnh khớp câu mô tả về vị trí hoặc hành động.","group":"3","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D3-004","set":"D3","n":4,"part":1,"q":"Which statement best describes the photograph?","options":["Two purses are next to the chart.","One man holds a briefcase.","Both men are standing by the whiteboard.","The men are laughing."],"answer":"C","explanation":"Hình ảnh khớp câu mô tả về vị trí hoặc hành động.","group":"4","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D3-005","set":"D3","n":5,"part":1,"q":"Which statement best describes the photograph?","options":["They're meeting at the street corner.","They're working with computers.","They're counting their money.","They're operating heavy equipment."],"answer":"B","explanation":"Hình ảnh khớp câu mô tả về vị trí hoặc hành động.","group":"5","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D3-006","set":"D3","n":6,"part":1,"q":"Which statement best describes the photograph?","options":["She's closing the doors.","She's looking in the drawers.","She's watching the clock.","She's holding a box."],"answer":"A","explanation":"Hình ảnh khớp câu mô tả về vị trí hoặc hành động.","group":"6","passage":null,"confidence":"verified"},{"id":"D3-007","set":"D3","n":7,"part":1,"q":"Which statement best describes the photograph?","options":["He's sitting on the desk.","He's eating a piece of cake.","He's looking at a piece of paper.","He's using a calculator."],"answer":"C","explanation":"Hình ảnh khớp câu m